From f44e2dff117c59661651605e49d539abe9f0ece9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 04:25:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] refactor: bring the merge's combined growth back under the
 health caps [daveey]

The upstream sync stacked fork and upstream growth in a few units past both parents'
ratchet caps. Behaviour-preserving moves/extractions only:
- desktop sidebar: nav rows hook -> nav-items.tsx, search merge -> search-results.ts,
  filter predicate -> session-filters.ts; projects store repo-discovery policy ->
  projects-repo-discovery.ts; local-runtime types -> types/hermes-local-runtime.ts.
- main_desktop PE helpers -> main_desktop_pe.py; session workspace SQL ->
  hermes_state_sessions_workspace.py; helper extractions in dashboard auth middleware,
  fleet verify, browser_exec; agent_factory fallback logs with a bound logger.
---
